    </section>

    <!-- COMPANY STORY -->
    <section class="osl-story">
        <div class="osl-wrap">

            <div class="row">

                <div class="col-md-7">

                    <span class="osl-label">Our Story</span>

                    <h2 class="osl-heading">
                        One Vision.
                        <span>One Solution.</span>
                    </h2>

                    <div class="osl-copy">
                        <p>
                            ONESPOT SOLUTION LOGISTIC was founded by
                            Rohit Kumar, a trucking industry veteran,
                            to provide a friendly, simple, and streamlined
                            approach to shipping and transportation needs.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            We provide transportation and logistics
                            services throughout India, with an emphasis
                            on open communication, customer relationships,
                            and practical solutions for different
                            shipping requirements.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            The combined experience of our management
                            team and our service-oriented approach help
                            shape the way we work with customers,
                            drivers, staff, and industry partners.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            We understand that each customer has unique
                            requirements. Our goal is to support those
                            requirements with flexible planning,
                            professional communication, and a
                            commitment to continuous improvement.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="col-md-5">

                    <div class="osl-story-panel">

                        <span class="osl-label">
